00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:40.960
to have success. For my brother, it was

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:42.880
literally his very first video that blew

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.640
up. For many clients I've worked with,

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.960
it might be the fifth or the 10th or the

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:48.160
15th, the 20th, the 30th, etc. But most

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.280
of them, when they're following the

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.280
system, when they're following this

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:53.679
method, they blow up within their first

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:55.520
30 videos. And they do those videos a

00:19:53.679 --> 00:19:56.960
lot faster than if they were just doing

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:59.679
them on their own. So you can almost

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:02.080
think about this like rolling a dice.

00:19:59.679 --> 00:20:03.679
You could be rolling a hundsided die or

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:04.880
dice, whatever. And if you don't know

00:20:03.679 --> 00:20:05.919
what you're doing, that's probably what

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:07.360
you're going to be doing, right? You're

00:20:05.919 --> 00:20:08.640
going to be rolling aundsided dice. So

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:09.760
it could take you a 100 times, but it

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:12.080
could also take you a lot more than

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:14.480
that. It could take you 200 or 300 for

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:16.960
you to hit number one, which is a video

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:18.320
blowing up. Then let's say if you really

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:19.840
know what you're doing and you're

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:21.520
following the right system and you're

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:24.240
following it the way it's supposed to be

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:26.160
done, you're rolling a six-sided die. So

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.919
that means you still need to hit one,

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:30.159
but you could hit it the first time, the

00:20:27.919 --> 00:20:32.240
sixth time, the 10th time, the 20th,

00:20:30.159 --> 00:20:34.320
etc. But it's just a matter of time

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:36.080
before you hit that one. So deeply

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:38.240
understanding on a logical level that if

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:41.039
you are following the right system, you

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:42.640
will get results is the first step of

00:20:41.039 --> 00:20:44.400
having the right mindset. That's the

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:46.720
logical side of things. But then the

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:48.559
second step is the emotional side of

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.919
things. Because a lot of people will get

00:20:48.559 --> 00:20:51.679
really hyped up. They know that they

00:20:49.919 --> 00:20:53.120
have a good system, but then you know

00:20:51.679 --> 00:20:54.559
they'll post their first five videos or

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:56.320
they post their first 10 videos, they

00:20:54.559 --> 00:20:58.240
don't have success yet, and then the

00:20:56.320 --> 00:21:00.000
emotions start coming in. They start

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:02.080
getting frustrated. They start getting

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.600
sad or angry. And the emotions start

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.360
coming in. And a lot of the time,

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:07.120
especially if you have this mindset of

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:08.400
you need to get results right away, this

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.400
is what's going to stop you from being

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:13.440
successful. So what I recommend

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:15.520
paradoxically is to expect it to take

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:17.760
over a 100red videos even if it only

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:19.440
takes one. This is exactly what I did

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:21.200
when I started my YouTube channel. This

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:23.200
is the mindset that I had. I literally

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:26.000
had the mindset that I am going to try

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:27.919
to make this YouTube channel work for 10

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:30.400
years and if it doesn't work after 10

00:21:27.919 --> 00:21:31.919
years, then I'll finally be allowed to

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:34.640
give up on it. But I am going to

00:21:31.919 --> 00:21:37.280
consistently post for 10 years come hell

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:39.679
or high water and I'm going to make it

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:42.320
work. And only after 10 years do I have

00:21:39.679 --> 00:21:44.559
the permission to stop trying. And

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:47.520
paradoxically because of the fact that I

00:21:44.559 --> 00:21:49.280
had such a long horizon and I was

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:51.760
thinking about it in a such a long

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:53.760
period of time I was able to get results

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:55.360
very quickly almost right away. And

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:58.159
that's because I didn't have a lot of

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:59.440
emotional conflict of me uploading a

00:21:58.159 --> 00:22:01.440
video and then getting super

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:03.200
disappointed when it doesn't immediately

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:05.039
do well. I knew that it was all going to

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:07.039
be a learning experience. And if one of

00:22:05.039 --> 00:22:09.440
my first 10 videos I upload and it

00:22:07.039 --> 00:22:11.919
happens to do well, that's just extra

00:22:09.440 --> 00:22:13.840
credit. I expected to upload hundreds of

00:22:11.919 --> 00:22:15.520
videos before one of them did well. And

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:17.120
this is the mindset that I want you to

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:19.120
have. I want you to have a long-term

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:21.120
mindset, but in the back of your mind,

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:23.120
know that there's a very good chance

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:25.520
that one of your first few videos or 10

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:26.960
or 20 videos is going to blow up. And

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:29.280
honestly, there's a lot more to this

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:30.880
mindset stuff, but the mindset of a

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:33.520
winning YouTuber, of a successful

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:35.520
YouTuber, is almost always different

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:37.039
than the mindset of an unsuccessful

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:39.039
